<para>This function should always be called before using the <ref refid="namespacesf_1_1Vulkan" kindref="compound">Vulkan</ref> features. If it returns <computeroutput>false</computeroutput>, then any attempt to use <ref refid="namespacesf_1_1Vulkan" kindref="compound">Vulkan</ref> will fail.</para>
